 launches on Steam Oct 28.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691395","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:15:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5186420-1846651706691379","game_id":"steam-5186420","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest is live: play the MMA Tactics demo now","summary":"Next Fest has started, and the MMA Tactics demo is playable now from this page. Sign a fighter, build their stats, and take them into the cage. Stand and strike, or take it to the ground and hunt for a submission. There is no tap button, and there are no second chances. The demo is free, and the full game arrives on Steam on Oct 28. If you enjoy it, please add it to your wishlist so you get a note on launch day. Tell me how your first fighter did in the discussions. I'm reading everything this w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691379","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:15:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5186420-1846018067941700","game_id":"steam-5186420","kind":"announcement","title":"MMA Tactics demo is in Steam Next Fest, Oct 19 to 26","summary":"MMA Tactics - Martial Arts is part of Steam Next Fest, Oct 19 to 26! The free demo has been out since Oct 1 and is playable right from this store page. Update 1.08 added full controller support, so you can play the whole demo on a gamepad or Steam Deck. It's turn based MMA management in the style of Battle Brothers. You build a camp, recruit fighters and take them up the rankings, and losses are permanent. Take it to the ground and fight from top or bottom position 7 submissions, and there is no","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T17:00:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941700","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:15:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5186420-1845383656394951","game_id":"steam-5186420","kind":"announcement","title":"MMA Tactics demo 1.08: full controller support","summary":"Demo update 1.08 is live. The big one: you can now play the whole demo on a controller, from naming your gym to the final bell. Controller The D-pad moves between buttons, A selects and B goes back. The right stick moves a cursor for everything else (map pins, cage hexes) and RT clicks. Dropdowns open with A, so you can pick a location, a graphics pack and your fighters on the pad. Renaming your gym opens Steam's on-screen keyboard. Fight buttons show Xbox button icons, and a small legend in the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T00:31:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394951","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:15:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5186420":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:27:46Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:27:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5186420":"2026-10-26T09:27:46Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5186420":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:27:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:27:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:27:45Z"},"5211900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:27:46Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:27:46Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:27:46Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5186420","app_id":5186420,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26